ocessing, Aluminium Processing, Turn-Key Solutions, and Plastic Manufacturing segments. The company engages in smelting of lead battery scrap/lead concentrate to produce secondary lead metal, such as pure lead, specific lead alloy, lead oxides, and lead products like lead sheets, lead powder, lead shot, etc.; granules, including polypropylene, polycarbonate, HDPE, and ABS; trading of taint tabor and tense aluminium scraps; and manufacture of alloy from melting of aluminium scrap. It also offers consultancy services for recycling operations; turnkey solutions for recycling processes and solutions; procures raw materials which include battery, aluminium, plastic, and rubber scrap; and extended producer responsibility recycler and compliance services. The company also exports its products. Gravita India Limited was incorporated in 1992 and is based in Jaipur, India."}}